+# Password Hashing Policy
+
+This project's authentication system uses Argon2id as its password hashing algorithm, chosen for its memory-hard construction and strong resistance to GPU/ASIC-accelerated brute-force attacks, providing better protection for stored user credentials than the previously selected bcrypt implementation.
